# ViRent design tokens

## Colors
- Primary: #5E244E (plum) — logo, navigation, primary buttons
- Accent: #E68457 (coral) — CTAs
- Destructive: #AA1C41 (crimson) — cancellation, errors
- Muted: #FFE8B4 (cream) — small surfaces only (badges, hover). NEVER as a full background.

## Status badge colors
pending→amber · confirmed→blue · active→primary · completed→green · cancelled→destructive · maintenance→gray

## Typography
- Heading + logo: Space Grotesk (self-hosted woff2)
- Body/UI: Inter (self-hosted woff2)
- Identifiers (license plate, booking ref, VIN): JetBrains Mono

## Logo
Wordmark only, lowercase "virent", Space Grotesk, #5E244E. No icon.

NEVER import from Google Fonts CDN — self-hosted woff2 only, `font-display: swap`.